00:39:40.670 --> 00:39:44.180
because we do
containerize everything.

00:39:44.180 --> 00:39:47.270
Because we want
to use Kubernetes

00:39:47.270 --> 00:39:49.700
to manage our deployments.

00:39:49.700 --> 00:39:53.167
And just to manage it.

00:39:53.167 --> 00:39:55.250
BRENT SHAFFER: A follow
up question then would be,

00:39:55.250 --> 00:39:57.350
of course--

00:39:57.350 --> 00:40:01.160
